Package: MorphoANOVA
Type: Package
Title: Histology and Gene Expression Decomposition in Spatial
        Transcriptomics
Version: 0.1.8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Authors@R: person("Po-Wei", "Chen", email = "ack7qw@virginia.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a sequential analysis of variance (ANOVA) framework using
    nested spatially varying coefficient models to examine relationships
    between spatial gene expression and H&E-derived morphology. Sequential
    F-tests assess slide-wide H&E effects, location-specific H&E effects,
    and additional spatial variation unexplained by the selected H&E feature,
    while increments in adjusted R-squared summarize the variance explained by
    each component. Provides fitted spatial components, pointwise inference,
    plots for single-gene and multi-gene analyses, component-specific gene
    rankings, tissue-composition correlation heatmaps, and GO and KEGG enrichment
    for biological interpretation.
